ls.\n\nDeterministic comparison produced 198 disagreements, 18 verified agreements, and three safe rejections. Three independent resolver shards adjudicated all 198 disagreements. Terminal conservation is exact: 219 = 198 resolver_verified + 18 verified_agreement + 3 safe_rejection, with 216 rows entering artifact-only staging. Existing Batch001-Batch006 and Batch007 v1 production/custody artifacts are unchanged.\n\nReview remediation at exact head `66fb231932545f74f226bda02dc6bb355eb38193` adds fail-closed terminal assertion and configured-lane identity validation, exact `candidate_responses_used: false` enforcement, Batch007 wrapper provenance, unique/full frozen identity conservation, and measured two-invocation reconstruction replay. The new receipts are additive v2 artifacts.\n\nVerification:\n\n- `issue_1674_structural_batch_007.test.py` — 4/4 passed\n- `issue_1674_resolution.test.py` — 5/5 passed\n- `issue_1674_final_resolution.test.py` — 6/6 passed\n- Batch006 regression suites — 5/5 and 5/5 passed\n- Batch007 import replay — 219 primary + 170 second reads, zero provider calls\n- final evidence publication twice — byte-identical hashes\n- Python compilation and `git diff --check` — passed\n\nKey SHA-256 receipts:\n\n- artifact manifest v2: `01a568a52421b0b07970cb35b1d0e1ad196babcdf32327b6e7d612da007f4501`\n- deterministic reconstruction v2: `0e036f323bebfe27c1275bbd31dd6bb6b766b3b1f4c3c55fcd73d90658873be1`\n- checker import validation v2: `aaddcd36f16703073e7dab7dfa660df8f8a6c7a61409564b8bf15a60820d80bb`\n- verification ledger: `ff564a90825f4f756d94ddd9c4ac0b67997c502af811400039a57236660dc97a`\n- verified staging: `101989f8cd15b3946ce0699951a8439b5d16624693b39fc1bf2f28c8071c5f94`\n- maker checkpoint: `436c5bd9488e3722f72069b7a7a6d13d539c9b48732d28c307bb61fda0e42ced`\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T20:58:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T21:22:38Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T21:22:38Z","merged_at":"2026-07-22T21:22:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"ae0cf8555964f0a26a202a4daa5a83